<title>USA: Mazda November US car sales fall.</title>
<headline>Mazda November US car sales fall.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mazda Motor Corp</p>
<p>			Nov 1-30, 1996     Nov 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	     5,160	     5,569	     -7.3</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	   3,090	     3,123	     -1.1</p>
<p> Import Car		 4,469	     6,602	    -32.3</p>
<p> Import Truck	     1,277	     1,002	    +27.4</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Nov 30, 1996 Jan 1-Nov 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Domestic Car	    80,609	    98,779	    -19.0</p>
<p> Domestic Truck	  39,609	    42,470	     -7.4</p>
<p> Import Car		90,266	   110,886	    -19.2</p>
<p> Import Truck	    12,961	    13,690	     -6.0</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 283 for year to date vs 281 in year ago.</p>
</text>
